' Data model relationships
Projects --> Tasks : contains
Employee --> Projects : manages
Employee --> Tasks : assigned via employee_id
Tasks --> WorkLog : tracked by
Tasks --> Comments : discussed in
Employee --> WorkLog : authored by
User --> Employee : 1..1 profile
User --> Comments : authored by
ProjectSkill --> Skills
TaskSkill --> Skills
EmployeeSkill --> Skills

note right of Main
	Main launches the JavaFX application and loads the initial GUI.
	The GUI layer is split into gui/ and fxml/ resource sets.
end note

note bottom
	The diagram includes all project files in these layers:
	Main -> GUI resources -> Controllers -> Services -> DAO -> DBConnection,
	plus models, utilities, DTO, and support classes.
end note

